<title>USA: TABLE - Riverside Q2 shr loss $0.07.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Riverside Q2 shr loss $0.07.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the quarter ended June 30,</p>
<p>			    1997		    1996</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $    0.07     profit $   0.11</p>
<p> Net loss		  393     profit	601</p>
<p> Revs		  239,915		   4,953</p>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures for the second quarter 1997 includes the results of the company's 52 percent owned subsidiary, Wickes Inc, on a consolidated basis. During the second quarter of 1996, the company owned less than majority interest in Wickes and accounted for the investment on the equity method. Included in the company's second quarter results were net realized investment gains of $633,000 and $743,000 for 1997 and 1996, respectively.</p>
<p>Full company name is Riverside Group Inc.</p>
